flowchart LR
  subgraph Laptop[Windows x64 laptop; no admin rights required]
    Z[MigraAI portable folder]
    Z --> PYDIR[python/<br/>embedded Python 3.12]
    Z --> APP[app/<br/>site-packages, models/, kb/]
    Z --> WEB[web/<br/>built React SPA]
    Z --> DOCS[docs/<br/>guide PDFs, diagram PNGs,<br/>report samples when present]
    Z --> README[README.txt]
    Z --> SC[start.cmd]
    APP --> PKGS[site-packages/<br/>MSVC runtime DLLs beside onnxruntime/capi]
    APP --> MODEL[models/ and kb/kb-v1.db]
    APP --> NOTICES[third-party-notices/]
    SC --> PY[python/python.exe -m migraai<br/>serves web/ on 127.0.0.1]
    PY --> PORT[_free_port binds port 0<br/>OS selects an available port]
    PY --> BR[Opens browser with one-time launch token]
    PY --> DATA[Default: %LOCALAPPDATA%\MigraAI<br/>MIGRAAI_DATA_DIR can override<br/>app.db, kb/, logs/, sessions/ wiped at start/exit]
  end
  PY -->|HTTPS 443; conversion code after consent,<br/>planning may send a summary on confirmation| DEVIN[Configured Devin API domain]
  PY -->|HTTPS 443 for optional KB refresh| VD[Vendor documentation sites]
